{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"code":"RestClient","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from async tasks and propagate cancellation from the caller. A cancelled URLSession operation may surface as ","type":"text"},{"code":"ApiError.cancelled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"URLError.cancelled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" depending on the operation path.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NetworkService.cancelAll()"},{"type":"text","text":" cancels all tasks in that service’s session. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalidate()"},{"type":"text","text":" also invalidates the session. Give separate features separate services when their cancellation lifetimes differ."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The error publisher is a Combine value. Keep its subscriptions alive for as long as the observer needs them, and deliver UI changes on the main actor.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST","overridingTitle":"Documentation index","isActive":true,"overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"text":"Documentation index","type":"text"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/roundtriprest\/cancellationandconcurrency"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST"]]},"metadata":{"title":"REST cancellation and concurrency","modules":[{"name":"RoundTripREST"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST\/RESTClient","doc:\/\/RoundTripREST\/documentation\/RoundTripREST\/ErrorsAndDecoding"],"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"